      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd like to bump this canny, which has just been made more relevant due to previous jury-rigged methods for imitating an \"IsFriend\" parameter, no longer functioning.\n\nExample in this Twitter post. https://twitter.com/hfcRedddd/status/1726887334808043842\n\nPreviously the strange legacy behaviour of cameras for friends, could be exploited to detect friend status and drive animations accordingly. With cameras finally being recognised and added to the safety settings (thank you), this has unfortunately also broken existing prefabs and animators that relied on it, with no known alternative.",
